  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving Global Rare Disease Patient Registry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changes in a gene called CACNA1C, which is highly expressed in the brain and the heart,  cause incredibly complex and variable symptoms - some of these can be life limiting. There are limited treatment options. This project supports the running of a worldwide patient registry for this rare genetic disease. It will allow researchers the ability to advance their knowledge of the condition and develop a means for prevention and treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
